{"title":"Sapling Treant","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Treant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: regrowthFracPerSec: .0075</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 1004, -65</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around 1004, -22</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sapling-treant?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sapling-treant\" data-map-level=\"17\">Show level 17 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1004, -51 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sapling-treant\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Treant: <a href=\"#/monster/oakheart-treant\">Oakheart Treant</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-treant\">Elder Treant</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/1e5337fd4c7c8220dcbc.webp\" alt=\"Sapling Treant\"></div><h3>Sapling Treant</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>17</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 20)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Treant</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>54</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>13.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>850</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}